{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-11-24T19:26:58.097Z","author":"codex-agent","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"codex","agent_model":"gpt-6.2-sol","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"30b717bc54dc7eb38bce2e14","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"gpt-6.2-sol","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"high","source":"probe"},"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-11-24T19:26:58.097Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-11-24T19:26:58.097Z","author":"codex-agent","text":"Current main at 10fa503 passed changelog:check with the previous pins. Dependabot PRs #368, #371, #372, and #373 each passed 1,171 tests, then failed changelog:check because their own dependency bump added an Unreleased bullet. The #369 toolchain job stopped at CI health before tests: the old filter recognized the combined stale-work warning and the new host also reports idle and unowned work. Both CI filters now admit those two advisory counts and still require the exact historical provenance baseline. Each actual filter passes the real health result, fails when reverted, and rejects five unsupported health inputs.\n\nThe initial full SDK run passed 1,167 of 1,172 tests with zero skips. Its five failures were custom-type enumeration, entry-from, dependency grouping, missing requested releases, and itemless dependency release notes. The old harness forwarded generate-only flags to export. The new host refuses those flags before dispatch with unknown_option and exit 2. Keep each existing assertion against documented command options and add a negative check for all four invalid flags. The previous and current published SDKs reproduced acceptance and refusal. The final nine affected files passed 62 of 62 tests.\n\nGeneration and release notes explicitly request dependency updates. The check inherits the same generation arguments. Removing either flag or bypassing check delegation failed the regression before restoration. Regeneration retained the published changelog byte-for-byte and all 33 dependency sections. Node 26 build, typecheck, test build, docstring lint (303 declarations), 115-file pack privacy scan, prepare, release-notes generation, release-date and attestation checks passed. Full npm and Bun release/coverage gates and packed matrices belong to CI. PR CI: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-changelog/actions/workflows/ci.yml?query=branch%3Adeps%2Fadopt-pm-cli-host-alignment-1122\n"}]}],"before_hash":"d10938b8a5e40a37b67962aa51e4321e5918e44e0e3a1668f37658290139ab90","after_hash":"307d1c13f7cfb9b2089682a6ed49ea07232cc3a66f1e9018b2b80ac41fbcdbe3","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"effort":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"codex_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"unavailable","reason":"harness_unavailable","resolver":"ai_agent_version","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e6b8cb4b5341e5e27f18966a37ef0089047625b044f1dfa2dac45f7c5c2b8ef2"}
